        "contenuto_esteso": "After a day where potential U.S.-Iran peace talks in Pakistan were in flux, President Trump extended the ceasefire indefinitely, though he kept a naval blockade in place. Iran had publicly not committed to sending envoys. It's a stark change from earlier Tuesday, when Trump said he wasn't interested in extending the ceasefire. \"I don’t want..."
